            low: 1.10,
            high: 1.60,
            chosen: true,
            rationale: "A pistol that opens with its precision shot (one exact bolt at 2.2 times the damage, 25 stamina, a 0.65 s commitment) kills the 30 m post faster than the plain pistol does, by at least the 1.10 a player can feel: the exact bolt lands where the plain one lands 6 times in 10, and one bolt of 52.8 is worth more than the two 24s the commitment costs. Measured 1.24 on 2026-10-13.",
        ),
        Band(
            name: "an-aimed-burst-pays",
