            chosen: true,
            rationale: "A carbine that opens with its aimed burst (five rounds in the aimed cone with no bloom, 25 stamina) kills the 30 m post faster than the plain carbine's bursts do, by at least 1.15: the rounds that scatter at 30 m land in the aimed cone. Measured 1.28 on 2026-10-13.",
        ),
        // Measured, not yet chosen: the three abilities that defend or change
